@stopVoice
@processInput set:Continue.true

@showPrinter YuinaPrinter time:0 wait!
@printer YuinaPrinter tint:#FF000099
@resetText YuinaPrinter

@char Yuina.Angry pos:23,0 scale:0.5 wait:false

@print "It's past eight already. Listen carefully: no enormous immersion marathons at this hour." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina waitInput! wait!

@char Yuina.Decided pos:23,0 scale:0.5 wait:false

@print "Sleep is when your brain starts sorting out everything you gave it today. A short, gentle session is fine, but forcing yourself through a tired one would only derail you. Take care of yourself for me, all right?" printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina waitInput! wait!

@hidePrinter YuinaPrinter time:0.15 wait!
@resetText YuinaPrinter

@char Yuina.Neutral pos:23,0 scale:0.5 wait:false
@stop